stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-07 15:29:20', 'review_text': "Love modern times kitchen!\n\nGreat beer as one might expect and particularly enjoyed the various stouts they had on tap. The food is good as well. They've carved out a nice section of the street where they've been able to put together a lively patio. \n\nA must stop when you're taking a day in Santa Barbara  - you won't regret it as a quick place to refresh and recharge."}]}
