keout order to help support small businesses. I wanted so badly for this to be my go spot, but given the excessive wait times, value for price and not so great service, it will instead be a one and done."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-11 21:06:00', 'review_text': 'We stopped here on our way to LA and the food was just EXCELLENT!... the double cheeseburger and fries were superb!! as well as the freeze and malt... this is definitively a hidden gem in the small beach town of Summerland.'}]}
