tely want to stop by again because the food was healthy, tasty, and fresh!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-10-17 03:24:08', 'review_text': "What a surprising treat! Came here for lunch to get quality food and avoid crowds. The atmosphere is quiet, comfy and green. The service was great and oh the FRIED RICE! It's delicious with their in house cured bacon. Highly recommend. The pork buns were a special treat to find and very good. The bacon waffle was delicious as well, made with high quality ingredients. It was a great experience."}]}
