nuous.  They opened the front door and a cold draft came into our area, making us want to leave immediately.  We were going to get doggie bags but it was too cold.  Not good.  I hope they read this.  We will be back, but another performance like that will lose them local customers, that take guests out to dinner..."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-21 22:04:34', 'review_text': 'Juan and Miguel have always made our days. We usually  go to brunch on the weekends for their wonderful entrees, bottomless minmosas  and amazing service. Thank you Juan and Miguel! We always leave with a smile on our faces.'}]}
