e one of the taprooms to order food from here - simply just walk in and get in line. Worth it!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-10-17 04:53:36', 'review_text': "I love coming to Lama for a beer and getting a turkey burger from the Nook! I've had a bunch of things on their menu but I think the fried chicken sandwich and the turkey burger are my favorite. If you're not hungry for a full meal, their truffle fries are also a great snack to go with your beer. I highly recommend coming here for dinner, a beer, and watching a game or just hanging with friends!"}]}
