en disappointed. It is a truly wonderful family-owned and operated small business with nice indoor & outdoor seating, mere steps from the beach. Don't sleep on this place. It may be in a student area but it is higher quality & more affordable than Sushi Teri etc. I've eaten here more times than I care to count, & will return whenever I'm in the area."}]}
