hallenge for some Restaurants but not the Breakwater! Basted Eggs  and Chicken Fried  Steak prepared to Perfection. Ed and Tanya both Enjoyed their Food as Well. \nAs we Celebrate the Christmas  Holiday season and Break Bread  with Family and Friends the Breakwater is a Great option or just about Anytime. Thanks To the Breakwater staff for the Great service and Oh Yes an Old Fashioned Ice Cream cone for dessert  \nMerry Christmas    and Happy New Year to my Yelp Family  in  2022'}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-05 20:41:47', 'review_text': "I was excited to take my dad for lunch on the harbor. The line wasn't  long, and we got a table in about 5min. The staff was friendly. The menu  is very outdated. A little pricey (paying for the view?). And the food  was just OK."}]}
