of each before tossing out the remaining contents of the tray. \n\nIts good that there is some cheap street food in IV--on the order of $3 a bun--but there was an apparent lack of diversity in flavors, as both were soaked in the same spicy red sauce. If you\'re not a fan of that specific cilantro sauce, which I imagine is pretty foreign to the Californian palette, this place is not for you--or me for that matter.\n\nSo if you want food that\'s all the same specific flavor, and a server who makes you uncomfortable, I guess this is your place.'}]}
