wenty minutes with servers ignoring us. Then lots of rudeness. Claimed to be the manager after telling us there was no manager. \n\nWent to Ca\'Dario instead and we\'re greeted with "good evening", and "welcome back". And great food and service. \n\nHave been a customer at Arnoldi\'s for more than eighteen years, but really watched its decline.\n\nJust worth going there any longer when there are so many MUCH better alternatives in Santa Barbara'}]}
