-out was quick and easy and we went home with enough provisions to see us through dinner that night (mostly, we needed wine). I like Vons fine, but it\'s nice to have Montecito Village Grocery as a pleasant, less busy alternative.'}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2021-08-08 12:02:22', 'review_text': "Bad service and expired products, its always hit or miss there, your better off going to Von's."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2019-09-10 15:53:32', 'review_text': "This neighborhood grocery store has awesome European speciality items, not found elsewhere.  From the Deli to yogurt, olives, to plant-based products: it provides quality food at its finest.  We've become accustomed to settle for the adjacent and lower quality in our diets: not cool.  Treat yourself, this grocery store is Delectable."}]}
