e the server screwed up the order. Instead she ate my toast. \n\nPricing: typical hotel restaurant pricing, but on the higher side compared to a regular restaurant."}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2021-06-01 00:49:12', 'review_text': 'Food was ok.  Had Eggs Benedict the muffin felt like it had been dipped in butter and the ham was thick which made it difficult to cut.  \nThe service was not great, sat and ordered and 20 minutes later another server came to take my order again?'}]}
