azing lunch!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-27 21:29:38', 'review_text': "Kale falafel burger was absolutely incredible. I've never really actively sought out vegan food, but this has made me start rethinking that. Super great flavor, and so nice to look at!"}]}
