 not picture takers. Our wedding was our first time having professional photos taken. Ryan was so easy to work with. We had never ending changes and Ryan was quick to adapt and make it work for us! He assigned us Chase who we adored. Chase made us feel comfortable and confident from the get go. You can tell he really loves his job and takes care of his subjects. I look forward to hiring BB again for family photos or other events. Book Burgundy Blue! You wont be disappointed!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-16 20:28:34', 'review_text': 'We absolutely loved working with Burgundy Blue Photography. The process was so stress-free and professional. The founder, Ryan, was great at coordinating what we were trying to capture on such late notice. Our photographer Chase made the entire experience memorable and fun for us. The pictures came out amazing! Thank you guys so much!'}]}
