heck these guys out!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-28 05:18:53', 'review_text': 'I purchase marinated taco meats from them and they are absolutely the best! They have rare Spanish sausages and produce, LA Street candy and lots more! Love Reyes Market!'}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-24 22:38:58', 'review_text': 'This place was pretty yummy! I am from Los Angeles and our Mexican food is hard to compare to other places. My family and I ordered posole, Mexican rice, and carne asada fries. The posole was my favorite.'}]}
