.  Confusing things between cultures kills your business which us why the restaurant was empty despite having good food, good beer on tap and sportsball on TV...."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-29 21:47:14', 'review_text': "Came here for lunch with a large group of 12 people. Everyone working here was so nice and accommodating. The service was fantastic. The food was fantastic, love that they offered vegan options. Very kid friendly. Love the outdoor seating. Can't wait to go back. Would absolutely recommend this place!"}]}
