duation and stopped at McDonald's at 10pm. Best customer service I've ever received. Crazy. The employee Boni truly an amazing, sweet, understanding and patient person. 10/10 service by Boni & I've honestly never been so happy leaving a McDonald's, ever in life. Thank you Boni!! U deserve the best!"}]}
