 - whole wheat tortilla, grilled chicken, jack cheese & romaine lettuce. \n\nHonestly, the burrito was only okay. If it were for the guacamole sauce, I wouldn't have like it one bit. The chicken was quite spicy (even though it didn't say it was suppose to be spicy) & there wasn't enough romaine lettuce in my opinion. However, each order does come with a side of tortilla chips & the burritos are definitely big enough to feed two!"}]}
