ac, cheese and salad. The taquitos were my favorite. My husband was hooked on their chille relleno burrito, and let me tell you it didn\'t disappoint. As for dislikes I would have to say their tacos. The chicken "street taco" was to dry and tasteless under seasoned. As were the beef and carnitas. Just not well prepared they need a little more love. They have the best salsas and best guacamole. The chip salsa was my favorite. The rice and beans are good too. Anyways the place is good I recommend it.'}]}
