 extra. Didn't get sauce.\npotstickers were burnt.\n ordered fried wontons, they were not in order.\negg drop soup had peas in it, WTF I hate peas.\nordered wor wonton soup. Had NO shrimp or chicken. Mushrooms onions and wontons.\n I ordered chow main extra spicy. Was bland and NOT spicy.\nWas a total fricking disappointing experience.\n This place is a crap shoot as to if they rock or suck.\nToday was suck. Not sure if ill ever go back.\nIf you want consistent good Chinese go down to chapala st.\nDoor Dash lies, will never trust again."}]}
