eir ketchup tasted odd to me. Service was ok for a place full of 20 something year olds working. Definitely a younger crowd here, a good spot to grab some beers and watch some sports.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-14 03:57:00', 'review_text': "Everything was so good! We forgot to take a picture of the Buffalo Cauliflower but trust me...it tasted as good as it looked! Peggy's chicken sandwich & the poke nachos we're equally good. Homemade chips  & truffle fries were amazing. Daughter added sausage to her Margherita Pizza & it  was good as well. I can't say enough good things about the food. Servings are large. Service was great as well. We will be back next time we are in SB!"}]}
