t all. If not. They obviously get zero stars.'}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2015-06-29 05:58:19', 'review_text': "It was a good experience BUT it was on the expensive side for hookah about $25/hookah which to me is a lot especially considering on the quality of hookah. The people were really nice and accommodating . Provably wouldn't come here again but a good experience since there aren't many hookah places around. Very lax and a pool table ."}]}
