presso is always strong and flavorful. I absolutely love their matcha -- I believe it's Mizuba and when you order it with honey and cinnamon it's delightful.\n\nI've also tried the croissants and the toasts and they're all super yummy. The cinnamon sugar one is probably my favorite.\n\nThe baristas here are some of the kindest people I have ever met. They are so genuine and warm, and I love seeing them when I order.\n\nThere is plenty of seating, always great music, WiFi, and just a really relaxing and cozy vibe."}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2021-10-02 21:32:09', 'review_text': 'I stopped by dune coffee roasters while I was waiting for my clothes to dry at the laundromat. The service was good and quick as there were not too many people when I went. They have a cute little outdoor patio with tables and a good amount of seating inside. I ordered a iced vanilla latte. It tasted good and refreshing, however, I wish it tasted a little sweeter and more vanilla.'}]}
