ffee Shop, it looks like a Denny's and the food is comparable. A little on the bland and greasy side of the aisle. I ordered Cinnamon Raisin French Toast and hashbrowns.\n\nFrench Toast - came out flat and mushy.\nHashbrowns with cheese - greasy and only crisp on top.\n\nCoffee was good and service was pleasant. \n\nNot worth a stop in my opinion!"}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2020-01-03 19:29:28', 'review_text': "Waitress is the only reason this place gets any stars! For 2 adults and a child it was $60! We could've gone to a steakhouse. The food was crap- soggy hashbrowns, chewy pancakes, watery coffee. Skip this place!"}]}
