orner of Milpas + East Canon Perdidio St. Not the easiest to see.\nNext to a tattoo place and shares a puny lot. Street parking might be available, but parking sucks in Santa Barbara.\n\nDecor/Interior: F\nFail. Bland. Outdated. Dark. No character.\n\nFood: A\nFood prepped as you order except for pizza slices which i didn't try.\n\nSalad: chopped up freshly and was soothing. Only two salad dressing options were available: ranch and balsamic. This didn't apply to me since I eat raw veggies often. If you eat plant based diet 95% of the time then your body begins to crave veggies opposed to meat and heavy fatty foods except when driving by in & out. Damn olfactories i tell ya.\n\nChicken eggplant: juicy and grilled to perfection. The sammich was really good. It was a simple fix with grilled chicken, eggplant, cheese and pesto base. I was expecting some veggies for some odd reason so I just added some of the delicious salad to the sammich and boooya! I think adding some red peppers, jalapenos, grilled mushrooms and grilled onions next time would make this a killer sandwich. \n\nOverall: C\nAverage. There was nothing special or crappy about the spot. It's just bleh with above average food. The ingredients used for my meal this time was ripe and fresh. Would return to try other items.\n\nHappy eatings and safe travels friends."}]}
