y, flavorful and fluffy. Their tacos are also really tasty during the week. Very nice staff, a real locals joint no tourists here. Maybe one of very best Mexican spots around Milpas which is saying a lot. Forget chicken ranch too much sodium aka heart attack 101. This is healthy and extremely tasty. Seasoning perfection.'}]}
