on his phone and helped others after us. Not worth the time when there are so many other bars in Santa Barbara. We left without service.\n\nI hope that ownership takes note of their staff's level of service and implements measures to improve upon it. A busy bar is one thing; the staff member scrolling through his phone while there are patrons waiting is a whole other level of low. You're going to lose customers!\n\nI now understand why this venue has an average rating of three stars, not four or five. A mediocre experience overall. Regretfully, I probably will not be back."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-08-27 04:29:42', 'review_text': "this place is not worth the exorbitant prices and rude, inattentive bar staff. it's not hard to see when someone is sitting at the bar trying to get your attention. like... it's literally your job, not social hour. f this place"}]}
