 and bring it here. That is something we don't have here. Your space is perfect for that type of food (foodie) experience. Please."}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2011-10-23 21:27:26', 'review_text': "I rarely order fish at restaurants, I've just had too many unpleasant experiences. \n\nHowever, I was told that I couldn't miss the paper wrapped halibut.  So I broke my rule...just for the halibut.\n\nIt was fantastic!  I highly recommend.\n\nShoot...it has already closed down."}]}
