he waiter specifically suggested "the salmon dish".\n\nThe dish cooked too dry and was not fresh.\n\nThere are fish bones in the meat.'}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2015-11-11 22:51:42', 'review_text': 'So not sure if they the restaurant was under contruction or whatever but happy hour ended up being at the bar area by the pool. Which was fine with us. \n\nWe got the brussel sprouts which were really tasty. We got the wings which had a thick herb topping on it. The wings were crispy and good but the herb topping and sauce were kind of lacking. We also got a salad that I cant remember in detail but I remember there were apples in it. It was crisp and refreshing. The drinks were kind of weak which was disappointing.'}]}
