 I found out that it's now newly owned and operated (which explains my terrible experience/service). The Buffalo fries don't even taste the same and it breaks my heart. They must've changed the recipe or something cause dear God, those taste disgusting. I've ordered fries only to take two bites out of it because of how bad they are. I hope this lady gets this business together, it's tearing down a beautiful culture that was built in IV. BRING BACK ORIGINAL BUFFALO CHICKEN CHEESE FRIES"}]}
