ie madness! \n\nAnd finally, they have M&M cookies! \nBest way to finish a darn good meal is to sweeten your palette with an American favorite, the M&M cookie! \n\n(Just a tip- Even if you do use the splendid Yelp24 take out service.. don\'t get as excited as I do and eat in the car. These sandwiches are carefully constructed and need full 1 on 1 attention, otherwise your lap will be getting full attention.)'}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2016-10-02 00:50:06', 'review_text': 'This place is overpriced and expensive.    The  service is terrible and the food is not that good.   They could update the place as well. 12 bucks for a sandwich.  No way.  The owner should take more pride.'}]}
