y. It was delicious and had a great depth of flavor. It was a bit oily, but not over-the-top. My friend ordered the ming bean noodle dish. It was really good as well, the flavor was a bit more tamed. It had a nice garlicky taste and the vegetables in it were delicious, especially the mushrooms which were perfectly sautéed. The pickled vegetables condiment was really nice and reminded me of the super salty pickled lime skin you get with some types of Indian cuisine. Great place - very vegan and vegetarian friendly.'}]}
