illa chips stale tasting, did not eat. Hubby says seafood pasta was "ok" nothing special. Would recommend coming here to sit outside, enjoy the view, popcorn, beer or cocktail but skip the menu.'}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2020-02-24 00:05:14', 'review_text': 'I enjoyed my nachos; however, I did not care for customer service. I didn\'t leave tip and felt so uncomfortable by not but really trying to promote my gratitude when it\'s due and when there\'s a lack of, the same. I felt that "my group" had to wait longer than others and we were greeted by a receptionist/host that was not at her station so we saw sign that says it\'s ok to look for our seat, she hurried and corrected us that the sign should of been turned over, we needed to wait for assistance, we did, she joined us in looking for space. Our food again was tasty but throughout time we did not think we had experienced good customer service and so much that I did want to say thank you for what I considered less than mediocre service, my group didn\'t feel good.'}]}
