c Vietnamese coffee you would get at other places, but pretty close! Super rich and a good source of caffeine if you need it :) Not very many interesting options on the drink menu, tho. A pretty standard coffee shop I would say.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2019-12-22 01:15:05', 'review_text': 'I had such a great experience at this coffee bean and tea leaf. Christine the store manager was awesome!\nAs I got my drinks sitting against the window with my mom she checked in to make sure our drinks were good... that meant a lot! What a great attitude she has!'}]}
