ocado salad with smoked turkey, which was very good. And a side of Elote that was excellent!  \n\nGreat food and worth your time!  Food 5. Beer 3."}, {'review_stars': 3.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-02 05:40:06', 'review_text': "The horchata was pretty good I think they added something else to it since it didn't taste like authentic horchata. I had the Little Gem salad, which was pretty good but I would've expected them to add some kind of meat to it? It was the half size but for almost $10 I really thought it could've been worth adding some chicken in it?\n\nThe street corn was atrocious. I would avoid this dish unless you wanna overpay for the taste of corn with barely any of the other stuff they supposedly add in there. Not even cotija cheese! I get that this is an Americanized version of Mexican food but honestly for $11 I only took one bite and I hated it. Social anxiety got the better of me and I should've asked for them to take it back and make me something else.\n\nAnyway, nothing about what I ate was outstanding so I doubt I'm coming back."}]}
