damn microwave and save us the dramatics. Or better yet, just make it fresh."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2011-11-15 17:37:42', 'review_text': "Pasta House disappointed--long wait 20-30 minutes & very sub par food--very spicy marinara, & bland veggies. A decent portion for the price, but i'd rather get a small amount of good than a large amount of mediocre bordering on bad..let's just say I could have done better myself. But I did like the garlic bread."}]}
