hleen and their gracious hostess who topped off the already great experience!\n--"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-17 06:17:24', 'review_text': "This place is insanely delicious. I don't often write reviews, but I'm a huge fan! Their fried rice was good, but next time I'm only getting the baos. We tried the pork belly bao, shrimp tempura bao, and the Korean fried chicken bao. They were all different and equally delicious! I highly recommend this place."}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-17 05:41:19', 'review_text': 'Not sure why this place has the reviews it has but the food was just alright. The flavors taste weird together. Id recommend them to add more sauce on the side, especially cus the bun is so thick and the protein filling is larger than the bun. It was a hard meal to get through. 2 stars though because the Duck Confit special was pretty good!'}]}
