': 1.0, 'review_date': '2019-04-13 23:50:55', 'review_text': 'My boyfriend and I wanted a late lunch/ snack. We decided to stay in the hotel to eat at this restaurant.  The vibe and food WASN\'T inviting. We just thought, "let\'s give this place a try."  SUPER DISAPPOINTED ON THE FOOD AND COST for this HOTEL!! Its pretty dry, tasteless, and expensive. (We ordered Nachos, Brussels sprouts, & Mahi Mahi fish taco). Did i mentioned that it was expensive too? GO ELSE WHERE FOR BETTER FOOD.Service was ok but we were there for food, Not the the service.'}]}
