 the first time and ran across Andersen's. Decided to stop in and have breakfast.\nWe were pleasantly surprised by food and service. We'll be back to this local fav!"}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-15 02:53:36', 'review_text': 'The staff was nice when we ordered. But after we sat down, my wife went to the restroom. To her surprise, there was poop on the floor that she accidentally stepped on. When we brought it up to the staff, we were brushed off. No apology, no nothing. I know the area has a homeless problem, but that should push management to keep the restaurant clean. Totally disgusting.'}]}
