: "This place is my go-to when I'm working and hungry. I used to get the combo bowl which comes with rice and steamed vegetables, along with angus beef and steak but now I get the combo bowl with bbq ribs and the grilled tilapia. The grilled tilapia is delicious with lemon and white rice with soy sauce. It's quick, easy and good"}]}
