e with my family and we are so happy there's a new menu. Give it a try!!"}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-19 23:13:07', 'review_text': "Waited 30min until asked to take our drink & food order. \nVery slow service, if your hungry don't expect to eat soon you will be waiting along time. We had kids and already sat down or else we would of left ."}]}
