hort break to eat ice cream and without a care sat with her shoes up on the seat. What is the point of sanitizing the tables when their employees will just do that? She even left her shoe mark on the seat. I wanted to take a photo but by the time I took out my phone to do it, she got up. I have never seen that type of unprofessionalism from a McDonald's employee. And I never had high standards for McDonald's. I suggest the owner to check the cctvs. Restroom for women were gross too!"}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-25 19:26:42', 'review_text': 'The COVID-19 "safety  precautions"that they have in place is completely ridiculous and utter overkill . It gives the bad attitude not friendly workers more reason to talk to the customers like we\'re stupid. Get over your Covid paranoia.'}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-10-12 03:08:13', 'review_text': 'When we made it inside, the lady that is "manager" told me and my husband to use the monitor to order... we took longer to try to put I my order... a man came in and walked to the register to place his order... when we finished placing the order the man had already received his order.. tell me how that makes sense?'}]}
