': 4.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-27 01:47:28', 'review_text': 'Excellent first stop we made in Santa Barbara.  This is more of a local pub than a fancy restaurant.  Upon walking in, we noticed the adorable house doggy walking around greeting guests.  We were sat quickly and ordered a couple of their house beers.  Yes, they do have great craft beer selection.  We ordered the salmon sandwich and the grilled chicken sandwich, both were good portions and tasted pretty good.  The only reason for the 1 star off is that the salmon sandwich was dripping a little too much grease/oil, but the flavor overall was good.  Nice attentive servers as well.'}]}
