aff at this market don\'t seem to care nor appreciate the business they are getting.  I will NEVER return again and will NEVER waste my time and money here!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-04 04:52:53', 'review_text': 'Great hole in the wall spot for Korean food! This place is really neat and doubles as both a restraint and a mini Korean market. We looked around the market while our food was being prepared and grabbed some ramen and calpico upon finding boReally enjoyed the bulgolgi and the sundubu. With the lack of Korean food in Santa Barbara, the food really hit home!'}]}
