he app says it's been delivered after about 30 minutes, with no other updates after. When I called them about this, they basically said it's up to the driver's discretion. This means that when the food finally arrives, it's usually cold. In addition, last time, they charged me for a ranch dipping sauce, but forgot to include it in the order. I'm over this place."}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2021-07-18 22:18:51', 'review_text': "Got half pepperoni and half multiple toppings because my toddler is a picky eater. They put all of the toppings on one side. This pizza looks like it's been sitting out for a week. Tracker said order complete but the order was not delivered for about 20 mins after. Missing one of the toppings as well."}]}
