 'review_text': "I have had two very enjoyable dining experiences at this café.  It seems to be the restaurant I always go to when I go up to Santa Barbara for a concert. Both times I was seated reasonably quickly (One time solo dining and the other with a group of friends). The service was quite good both times - which was particularly remarkable on my most recent visit because it was during a very busy Saturday night service. Even though it was busy, it wasn't super loud, IMO. The outdoor seating patio area is very nice and on this most recent visit I sat inside and the atmosphere was very pleasant (and all staff were masked and I felt perfectly fine in that regard).  Most importantly the food is YUM *and* they have several vegetarian friendly options.  I look forward to my next visit."}]}
