w_date': '2019-05-11 23:09:43', 'review_text': "Thought we would try something new. This place did not disappoint. The popcorn chicken and bento box were out of this world. Too much food for two people...we brought food home. Popcorn chicken is fried and served with a curry mustard sauce (crazy good). The bento box had excellent kimchi to go with the chicken over rice...also corn, egg and seaweed salad. They serve beer. The decor is bland with only the largest tv I've seen in my life. Bathroom clean was a bonus. Nice staff though you order at the counter and they serve you. Really impressed."}]}
