ervice was incredibly slow, even just for a couple of beers. We stumbled upon this place while walking around town so we decided to pop in as it was very lively. \n\nI definitely prefer Test Pilot over this place, and they also had a very crowded weekend- but the service was still great. We tend to hop around to check out multiple bars to compare which ones we enjoyed the best. Probably a good idea to add more bartenders to improve the service as it seems that is what's missing in order to have a better experience at the Good Lion."}]}
