inks. I sat at the bar watching MNF enjoyed my Margarita and diner as I was eating I was paying attention to the Bartender Juan he was non stop running every direction serving everyone I was surprised how quick my diner was ready I enjoyed this place very much and I will definitely bring the guys up here working with me here to eat and thank you Juan awesome bartender.'}]}
