hought to make something like this myself,  I'm inspired!  I will go back to try more soon."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-11-21 04:49:32', 'review_text': 'Sublime empanadas in a hidden gem of Carpinteria.  Enjoy an array of delicious delights at the hand of a a craftsman. The perfect pair to an afternoon of cider or beer.'}]}
