d has a nice spicy kick to it but still mild for someone (like me) who likes super spicy things. One tip to get the most bang for your buck if you have leftover broth: if you have instant noodles or ramen/udon/etc at home, you can add it to the broth to get another delicious meal out of it. 10/10 highly recommended."}]}
