ess that's why this is the Funk Zone!\n    I go to take our plates back in and see on the door that it was opening time.  We had showed up half an hour before opening time!  That's why the kitchen and patio weren't set up!  I can't believe they served us.  I thanked everyone profusely and walked out to the sound of live piano music.  Great breakfast experience!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2014-12-31 23:36:55', 'review_text': "The food and service here are great. I recommend this to anyone who is looking for great food. It is very affordable and tasty. It's a must if you are in the area. Thanks for a great time L."}]}
