nd the iced oat vanilla latte).'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-09-09 17:47:38', 'review_text': "My mom and I spent the holiday weekend in Montecito at this resort,  was exactly what I expected ..just a  wonderful get a way.  Amazing breathtaking views ,  staff is very polite and helpful ..Emily at the bar above Caruso's was so kind and wonderful!  A must stay if you're ever in this area ..best Resort I've been to in years.."}]}
