s for an appetizer. \nNo bread, and if you wanted potatoes with your dish, it was an extra $5.00. Really not good."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-07 08:22:47', 'review_text': "We were just passing through SB and found La Paloma Cafe.  It was excellent!  JTs salad was fresh and eclectic.  The vegetable verde pozole was flavorful.  GiGi our server was helpful and knowledgeable.  I'll be back when I don't have to drive to try the cocktails!"}]}
