 2.0, 'review_date': '2018-01-12 07:47:41', 'review_text': "The first time I tried Pascucci was at a banquet I attended. It was great so I decided to stop by one of their locations. Service is VERY slow, even on slow nights. Even getting our bread took a long time. Portions are small, especially for the price. The first time I got the fettuccine Alfredo, I liked it. Not amazing, but good enough to order again. The next time I ordered it, it wasn't good. The chicken left a taste I can only describe as disgusting in my mouth and the sauce itself was bland. I was a little discouraged, but I ordered it again the next time I was there. It was just as bad as the previous time. That was the last time I went. Some dishes are ok, but again, not great and pretty small,  so I would pick another establishment over this one. I really wish I could have liked it as much as the first time I tried it, but unfortunately that was not the case."}]}
