 {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-09 01:41:09', 'review_text': 'This restaurant is great.  The food is excellent.  The quinoa bowl was fantastic. Great quality. The staff is great, especially Michael the bartender.  Everyone is professional. The room itself is very elegant. Thank you for the wonderful experience!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-25 23:23:16', 'review_text': '5 start service and delicious food. We had the Christmas brunch buffet today and it was absolutely delicious and a lovely experience.'}]}
