ich and it was horrible.  The bread was dry the spirinkling of bitter iceburg lettuce and soggy tomato just made everything worse.  There is no love in the food at this place.  How do places so bad stay open.  I would never go back if someone even offered to buy me lunch.  my stomach is ont very happy!'}]}
