lucky and had " the last one". I saw the cashier guy who had just counted back my cash, go straight to them with no gloves on and not washing his hands. As I waited two different customers came in to order some pizza, and the same cashier told them that they only have thin crust. Customer walked out. The other one looked and me and said that they are always out of items or they are just to lazy to bake them. I stood there watching the lady in the back prepare a pizza without gloves on.  This place needs a new manager....  Oh and btw I did get my crazy bread and the breadsticks where harder than a rock ...... and cold. Smh'}]}
