ail address for color pictures. I will now send this store Board of Health Santa Barbara. CA\nAlso, the employee, women, with long hair, who took care of me, should stop going to the window, and playing with her hair, while she is making pizza. You can tell who this is by store receipt and time.\nOn December 17th , I was having a problem placing an order, I called Store # 7873  MILPAS STREET, SANTA BARBARA. . I can't tell you how disappointing this lack of customer service has been after all of the years that I have been a Domino's customer. AND TO ADD INSULT TO INJURY. ITS NOW BEEN 2 WEEKS, WAITED TO WRITE THIS, AND STILL NO REPLY FROM STORE OWNER, STORE MANAGER, OR CORPORATE OFFICE.  PLEASED TO REPORT BOARD OF HEALTH WAS ON TOP OF THIS."}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-20 20:54:56', 'review_text': "We are usually happy with our pizzas from this dominos. Today's order was awful. Pizzas were way under cooked and the border was 4-5 inches with no cheese or toppings. Like eating a large dough ball."}]}
