me you would take a bit your teeth would sink into soft buttery goodness. The lobster was so good to mix with the bread as well with its soft texture in every bite I couldn't get enough of it the lobster had the right seasonings on and everything. When I tried the chips I thought to myself that the chefs know what they where doing. I loved the chips it had a crunch in every bite with the seasoning it added even more flavor than I could handle. This place was the best restaurant to go to that you can't stop eating it I really recommend if you want lobster."}]}
