equiles came with green sauce instead and was missing the al pastor. Everything was delicious but sad about the mistakes in the order. Also green sauce was spicy.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-19 22:57:03', 'review_text': "Walked In basically because it was across the street from my hotel. Asked the adorable husband and wife owners what was good and got the most amazing dish unlike any Mexican food I've ever had. I'm sure the rest of the menu is just as good - so much obvious love goes into the food."}]}
