lly with a side of sriracha mayo! Only complaint is that it is very difficult to eat when served on such a small tray.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-10-23 06:38:01', 'review_text': 'Really pleasantly surprised with the $5 BBQ Bacon burger at The Habit! It was juicy, sumptuous, and worked very well with the balance between bbq sauce and mayo. The bun was toasted well, which added to the lovely texture of the bacon, lettuce, and tomatoes. Overall, really pleasant and good burger!'}]}
