out and it was missing the beans/rice cart blanche order.  My wife's combo of an enchilada and taco was missing its beans/rice.  No sauce in the enchilada-- terrible, terrible, terrible.  And add to this insult -- no napkins or plastic utensils.  I only hoe is that we don't get sick from the meal.  I didn't eat much of the meal -- so sad.  So for $23 I got no satisfaction."}, {'review_stars': 4.0, 'review_date': '2020-10-09 06:26:27', 'review_text': 'Their Torta Ahogada is amazing! Now this is Mexican food. The sauce they use is spicy spicy but that good heat you get mad at your mouth for not being able to handle it because you want to keep on eating.'}]}
