ooked good too and so want to get that next time!"}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-31 06:04:16', 'review_text': "Best hot dogs in Santa Barbara by far! Favorites are the Chicago, Hawaiian, & Santa Barbara dogs. The deep fried Oreos are divine. Always get great service & consistently fantastic food. Check out Dave's - you'll be back for more!"}]}
