f he wanted to stay.  We said we'd made a reservation and then we started hearing about what a busy weekend they'd had but they'd check on the reservation -- as we watched the chef leave through the front door.  Then we were told they were out of many items due to earlier business.\n\nSince we didn't get to eat, I can't comment on the food.  I later heard that the restaurant is under new management -- if this is true, I'd suggest some intensive staff training."}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2016-11-11 01:42:10', 'review_text': "Really not pleased with the visit tonight. I've had so much better from this place in the past. We had a hair in out fries.Nuff said."}]}
