e we visited, and they said it was so delicious. I  love their great selection of sandwiches, so creatively combined, like 'The Griller' or the New Yorker...and many more.....Unfortunately, I think their hours and days open have changed, so it's wise to check before going. We tried this past Friday @ 3 p.m. and they were closed. Hopefully, it is not closing, after so many years around. Over 20 yrs. visiting for me....\nIt will forever be a favorite of mine."}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2016-09-03 00:45:03', 'review_text': "Thanks Yelp for the recommendation! The fish and chips were the best we've ever had!! The onion rings were delicious too!"}]}
