mobile, the Funk Zone is very walkable from a lot of points of interest in town like the beach, the wharf, the Public Market and the Presidio.\n\nParking might not be the best, but like I mentioned before, it\'s within walking distance of a lot of places you\'d be walking to/from anyway.'}]}
