ld bring me here as a kid after school with my nerd folder organizer box in 80\'s for chocolate milkshakes at the counter, they had best in town. They still have real milkshakes made with those special classic blenders here so that\'s great. This is under new ownership from group that owns Brophy. I love all their restaurants but this OJ here has to go. Also my toast was served cold. The food is very good just disgusting OJ, not fresh at all and way overpriced. This was always a true locals spot and still has that vibe so that\'s a good thing. The new owners did a great job respecting the history of restaurant while also modernizing it. This is one of oldest eateries in town with Joe\'s. Nostalgia 101.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2022-01-05 06:38:41', 'review_text': "Farmer Boy is a staple in Santa Barbara. Been coming here for years and the service as well as the food is always consistently tasty and great!! I highly recommend this place always!! To anyone and everyone. It's easy to make a plate vegan and or vegetarian. They will work with you."}]}
