orful Thai places around. Delicious food for an amazing price!'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2021-07-09 03:09:18', 'review_text': "I'm not sure what's up with the bad reviews here. Thai Kitchen easily has the most consistent Pad Thai I've ever ordered from any Thai Restaurant, and it tastes damn good; it's the largest portion of Pad Thai I've ever been served, yet also the cheapest Pad Thai I've ever been billed. While other places' Pad Thai often come delivered dry and bland, Thai Kitchen has always delivered moist and flavorful Pad Thai, which is a surprisingly hard feat I've found.\n\nAlso tried their Coconut Water and Thai Tea in the past. Those are good, but nothing special. \n\nIf you like Pad Thai and/or want something good on DoorDash, I guarantee you (Pennie's) Thai Kitchen does not disappoint."}]}
