od food for the money.'}, {'review_stars': 5.0, 'review_date': '2016-05-17 21:52:32', 'review_text': '***REVIEW FOR STREET SHOP***\n \nThere was an awesome car show going on that Saturday and in the corner we found this amazing pop up shop. It invited you in with incents and beautiful Indian textiles. Upon walking in this homemade tent you can see wall to wall art. There was Indian imported rugs, clothing, metal ohm symbols, hand carved wooden jewelry boxes, handmade cloth posters and much more. The jewelry initially caught my eye they are very unique items.  Everything was in a rich coloring and beautiful taste. I stumbled upon a large cloth poster of Mother Lakshmi. It was bright in color and had beautiful beads on it. I knew instantly that I needed it! Not only was this a wonderful part run in but the owner was delightful.'}]}
