t stress. So many delicious VEGAN options! The prices are very fair, especially when compared to SB pricing. They even have vegan soft serve. The dillies and mighty bowl are my favorites, but I know I can keep returning for other amazing vegan options. Plus, the rooftop is an amazing place to eat.'}]}
