he good work"}, {'review_stars': 1.0, 'review_date': '2016-03-31 19:45:20', 'review_text': "The employees didn't seem to care, they also didn't cut the bread correctly and the sandwich was falling apart. Make the trip to another subway, it'll be worth it."}]}
