to the Brussels sprouts, cauliflower, and arugula, but they weren't super excited. \n\nOverall, I didn't really like my meal, however, on a positive note--\n1) I appreciate that Santa Barbara Craft Ramen took a chance on a bold Veggie Ramen recipe -- you never know 'til you try! Maybe they'll fine tune it and dis-invite some of the current friends to the Veggie Ramen party (i.e. dried cranberry and pumpkin seed) and invite some new ones (perhaps mushroom, maybe corn?) \n2) Our server was really great\n3) Good location, right in mix of things on State Street"}]}
