e menu is kinda all over the place. All in all...a good experience.'}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2021-12-01 06:53:23', 'review_text': "Went during lunch to celebrate a birthday with my partner. Service was okay. Not very attentive towards the end and we were the only people left. Sat around a few minutes waiting for our check. Food wise: ordered oysters- can't really go wrong with that. The squid ink pasta with uni butter didn't have much flavor. Sounds great on paper, that's about it. The fish picatta on the other hand, had great flavor, but beware, you'll still be hungry after eating everything on the plate (fish & green beans). I knew I should've just ordered pizza. Overall, nothing amazing and I don't see myself going back, especially to celebrate a birthday."}]}
