de was ridiculous. I totally understand If he wasn\'t allowed to offer me a drink, but at least say it politely without attacking my character? And even after that, I open the box of the food I patiently waited for to see and unfortunately taste that both my orange chicken and Beijing beef have been not only cooked in bad/old oil, but also the protein itself was old. With the health concerns going around campus I think it\'s in the UCens best interest to be serving FRESH well prepared food. I\'m curious to see the sanitary conditions in the back of that kitchen. Anyways other than the nice man who offered me a drink, my overall experience here lacks even one star. Should\'ve gone to subway.'}]}
