oddler noticed that he wasn't friendly. There weren't any seats to sit outside so we opted to sit inside as I had my two younger children with me. The entire time we were sitting inside it was extremely awkward and quite. For it being an ice cream shop you would expect some cheerfulness. Not here. I also noticed he gave himself a three dollar tip which I did NOT authorize. I wouldn't have normally disputed a charge like this but it's the principle. He definitely has a reputation for this after reading all of his bad reviews. Please DO NOT support this small business."}]}
