ll them the next morning. We will happily be going there again!"}, {'review_stars': 2.0, 'review_date': '2011-12-29 06:02:49', 'review_text': 'food was nothing special, hard to hear any of the  tvs over the noise, bartenders in my opinion were some of the worst i ever had( to worried about the girls coming in and not the patrons !!) . i had to wait 30 mins!! thats right !! for one of the bartenders to ask me if i wanted  another beer.. hey i understand the girls here are HOTT but dude im spending MONEY!! i think their boss would agree..only went once here and will not go back when im in town.. sorry'}]}
