aling with the public. Do they also think it's not necessary to follow public health requirements that restaurant employees wash their hands after going to the bathroom or handling raw meat? For a place that supposedly serves healthy food, they have sent a clear message that their preferences are more important than their customers' and employees' health. I won't be returning."}]}
